From a83ea73a4ed0bb88cdbfb4021ce665f68225b33e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: superc <superc@localhost>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:32:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] superc: move the extension tests out of tests2

The superc tests are written as superc 'test' blocks and live in the
top-level tests/ directory now, so tests2 stays exactly the upstream
suite (134 tests in both the extension and the plain build).

Drop 156..177 from tests/tests2 and the SUPERC_TESTS block in
tests/tests2/Makefile.
